# Example arguments for the SF-8b repair rollout evidence collection planner.
# Supply reviewed, payload-free staged evidence paths. Run with:
#   python3 scripts/run_sorafs_repair_rollout_evidence.py @scripts/examples/sorafs_repair_rollout_collection.args.example --dry-run
